# Claude Opus 5.5 (the P0 fixer), unreviewed. Live state the contracts add
# under ROOT, which is the checkout's root by default: address cards (C1,
# each names an ssh user@host), the outbox (C3, whole message bodies) and
# the shared-mailbox marker (C4). Anchored, so a tracked folder of the same
# name deeper in the tree is not hidden.
/cards/
/outbox/
/.shared
